<div class="wub-guides-container">
    <div class="wub-guides-card">
        <div class="wub-guides-header">
            <i class="fa fa-book-open-reader fa-2x mb-2 text-primary"></i>
            <h2>{{#str}}guides_heading, local_wub_auth{{/str}}</h2>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Official assistance and onboarding for students, faculty, and administrative personnel.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4">
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm p-3 bg-light">
                        <h5 class="h6 font-weight-bold text-dark mb-2">
                            <i class="fa fa-graduation-cap text-primary mr-1"></i> Student Portal Access
                        </h5>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Sign in using your 10-digit Student ID (e.g. <code>0326745530</code>) or institutional email. Initial passwords are your student ID unless changed.</p>
                        <ul class="small text-muted pl-3 mb-0">
                            <li>Review and accept the 20-clause E-Learning Policy.</li>
                            <li>Ensure tuition dues are cleared with UMS.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm p-3 bg-light">
                        <h5 class="h6 font-weight-bold text-dark mb-2">
                            <i class="fa fa-chalkboard-user text-primary mr-1"></i> Faculty Portal Access
                        </h5>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Faculty members sign in using institutional faculty credentials or registered faculty email address.</p>
                        <ul class="small text-muted pl-3 mb-0">
                            <li>Access course spaces and grading tools.</li>
                            <li>Multi-role accounts default to faculty capabilities.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm p-3 bg-light">
                        <h5 class="h6 font-weight-bold text-dark mb-2">
                            <i class="fa fa-user-shield text-primary mr-1"></i> Administration
                        </h5>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Institutional administrators, coordinators, and support staff with system permissions.</p>
                        <ul class="small text-muted pl-3 mb-0">
                            <li>Manage special permissions and waivers.</li>
                            <li>Monitor system health & UMS diagnostics.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-white border rounded">
                <h6 class="font-weight-bold mb-2"><i class="fa fa-life-ring text-info mr-1"></i> Need Additional Assistance?</h6>
                <p class="small text-muted mb-1">If you experience issues logging in, password synchronization errors, or enrollment discrepancies:</p>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-2 text-muted small">
                    <div><strong>IT Support:</strong> support@wub.edu.bd</div>
                    <div><strong>Accounts Office:</strong> accounts@wub.edu.bd</div>
                    <div><strong>Helpline:</strong> +880 9643 204060</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 text-center">
                <a href="{{landing_url}}" class="btn btn-primary px-4">
                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-left mr-1"></i> Back to WUB Portal
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
